:"machinescreen","id":132695269,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-jE5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132695269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen","html_url":"https://github.com/machinescreen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-04T22:35:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T23:03:57Z","body":"> Out of curiosity, what display scaling percentage is your Windows installation set to?\n\n100% on my desktop.\n\nI have a laptop set to 125% that also displays the issue.\n\nI have another laptop set to 100% that doesn't (this is the one with integrated graphics I already mentioned). \n\nMight be useful to know the system info for the unaffected device is: _Godot v4.6.3.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL ES 3/ANGLE (Compatibility) - ANGLE (Intel, Intel(R) HD Graphics 620 (0x00005916) Direct3D11 vs_5_0 ps_5_0, D3D11-23.20.16.4973) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-7100U CPU @ 2.40GHz (4 threads) - 3.86 GiB memory_.\n\nSo I assume it's not affected because it's using ANGLE rather than native OpenGL.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5185376529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0